    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>General Feat (Prerequisite: Level 4+)</em></p><p>You gain the following benefits.</p><p><strong>Ability Score Increase.</strong> Increase one ability score of your choice by 1, to a maximum of 20.</p><p><strong>Skill Proficiency.</strong> You gain proficiency in one skill of your choice.</p><p><strong>Expertise.</strong> Choose one skill in which you have proficiency but lack Expertise. You gain Expertise with that skill.</p>",
